{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate monthly welfare updates and photos for owners of all seized dogs",
        "additional_details": "Many seized dogs are held in kennels for extended periods. I'm worried that these dogs may return home in poor physical and mental condition.\r\n \r\nMandating monthly welfare reports and photographs could help ensure accountability, maintain higher standards of care, and allow for necessary intervention before a dog's health reaches a breaking point.",
        "background": "I am campaigning to mandate monthly welfare reports and photos for seized dogs I think this is essential to ensure accountability, uphold humane standards of care, and enable timely intervention to prevent suffering.",
